cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in your research, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Hyderabad Electoral Analysis, 1999-2023: constituency vote shares for five old-city assembly seats"
abstract: >-
  Party vote-share data and an interactive report covering six assembly
  election cycles (1999, 2004, 2009, 2014, 2018, 2023) across five
  constituencies in Hyderabad district: Bahadurpura, Chandrayangutta,
  Charminar, Malakpet and Yakutpura. Parties tracked are AIMIM, TDP, MBT,
  INC, BJP and TRS/BRS. This is a descriptive series and contains no
  infrastructure or service-delivery data; see METHODOLOGY.md for what the
  comparison can and cannot establish.
authors:
